                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f92f0c-2434-4ba0-a77d-03dd967f99f8",
                                                "sense_id": "21838bb0-59f7-3f1e-ab75-885bbfd74d84",
                                                "text": "Citizenship in the original Greek concept was not simply the granting of rights to do as one pleased;\nit also demanded a commitment to serve the interests of the many via personal sacrifice."
